      "id": "operator-precedence",
      "title": "Operator Precedence",
      "type": "content",
      "duration": "4m",
      "content": "<p>Operator precedence determines the order in which operators are evaluated in an expression. Parentheses <code>()</code> have the highest precedence and can be used to force an evaluation order.</p>"
    },
